 "paragraph_overrides": {
  "9": "However deftly she handles all this, Ms Kress is unlikely to keep the job for long. She lacks a technical background; Bloomberg reports that the board has been working with an outside recruiting firm to find a permanent replacement. Among insiders, Ian Buck, who runs Nvidia’s data-centre computing business, is popular with engineers but untested at running a giant company. Lisa Su of AMD and Rene Haas of Arm, a former Nvidia executive, may be options. Nvidia may yet find that the answer to its succession problem lies at the company that showed it how succession should be done."
 }
